Test resources:
- backend/test/resources/salamander/: sounds made of the Salamander Grand Piano
  V3's samples, by Alexander Holm, Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
  (https://github.com/sfzinstruments/SalamanderGrandPiano).
- backend/test/resources/rendering/synthetic-mix.wav: a sound made with VIOLET.

The models' weights, the sound bank (GeneralUser GS, by S. Christian Collins),
the piano's samples and ROCm are not part of Ripieno: the server downloads them
from where their authors publish them, under their own licences.
